### Phase 1: Mobile-First CSS Foundation & Critical Overflows
*Establish the unified breakpoint scale (`sm`: 480px, `md`: 768px, `lg`: 992px, `xl`: 1280px), transition to `min-width` media queries, and fix the most severe mobile shatters.*

#### [MODIFY] [frontend/css/main.css](file:///c:/Users/HSEF%202026/Downloads/Hilgodonlineshop/frontend/css/main.css)
- Implement fluid typography using `clamp()` for headings and `.section-title`.
- Create a global button layout system (`.btn-mobile-full`, `.btn-group`, `.btn-sm` with min-height 44px).
- Harmonize solid button heights with outline buttons by adding transparent borders.

#### [MODIFY] [frontend/css/products.css](file:///c:/Users/HSEF%202026/Downloads/Hilgodonlineshop/frontend/css/products.css)
